            "Objects_ContentFormatting_RenderMode_Description": "Controls how the visual updates the DOM when the underlying dataset (or a volatile property) changes. Rebuild content redraws everything on each update. Preserve unchanged content keeps entries whose value has not changed, so embedded content such as iframes does not reload.",
